    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does digital marketing cost for a doctor or medical clinic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"4 tiers: Starter Rs 45,000/month (solo doctor + Rs 3-8 lakh/month clinic revenue), Growth Rs 75,000/month (2-3 doctor clinics, Rs 10-40 lakh/month revenue), Premium Rs 1,50,000/month (multi-location or premium single-clinic Rs 40 lakh-2 crore/month), Enterprise Rs 3,00,000/month (chains + hospitals Rs 2+ crore/month). Ad spend separate + transparent pass-through (no markup). Serves all major India cities (Mumbai + Delhi + Bangalore + Ahmedabad + Pune + Hyderabad + Chennai + Kolkata + Gurgaon + Noida + Jaipur + Chandigarh + Thane + Nashik + Nagpur) + GCC (Dubai + Abu Dhabi + Sharjah + Riyadh + Jeddah + Doha + Kuwait City + Manama + Muscat) + international (London + Singapore)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What services does ITD provide for doctors and medical clinics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full-stack: social media management (Instagram + Facebook + YouTube), Instagram Reels + viral short-form content, on-site photography + video shoots at your clinic (we bring the team + equipment), Meta + Google performance ads, Google Business Profile + local SEO (map pack ranking), patient lead generation via WhatsApp + landing pages, website + online booking + WhatsApp Cloud API integration, content marketing + educational content, branding + PR + celebrity partnerships (Premium+). We work with dermatologists, dentists, IVF specialists, orthopedics, cardiologists, cosmetic surgeons, trichologists, ENT + eye specialists, pediatricians, and multi-specialty clinics."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your experience with dermatology / skin clinic marketing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We currently run full-stack marketing for a premium dermatology + skin clinic brand with 5+ clinics across India — social media management, Instagram Reels + viral content, organic content strategy, and paid performance marketing. Case study available on discovery call (client name shared under NDA). We also serve 20+ other clinic clients across dermatology + trichology + hair transplant + dental + cosmetic surgery verticals across India + GCC."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which cities does ITD serve for doctor and clinic marketing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"India: Mumbai (Andheri + Bandra + Powai + Juhu + Colaba + Malad + Goregaon + Ghatkopar + Mulund + Dadar), Delhi + NCR (Gurgaon + Noida), Bangalore, Ahmedabad, Hyderabad, Chennai, Pune, Kolkata, Jaipur, Chandigarh, Lucknow, Kochi, Indore, Coimbatore, Thane, Navi Mumbai, Nashik, Nagpur + all major India cities. GCC: Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, Riyadh, Jeddah, Dammam, Doha, Kuwait City, Manama, Muscat. International: London, Singapore, Toronto, Sydney + more on request. Remote onboarding globally + on-site photography/video shoots for India + GCC metro clinics."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What makes ITD's approach unique for doctors and clinics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"ITD is a full-stack agency: social + Reels + on-site video + photography + Meta+Google ads + GMB + WhatsApp + patient lead-gen + website + branding — all under one team. Real case studies from a premium 5+ clinic dermatology brand + 20+ active clinic clients. Transparent 4-tier pricing (Rs 45K to 3L per month) — no hidden fees. Serves all major India + GCC + international cities with on-site team availability across metro India + GCC. Compliance-safe workflow (MMC + MCI + ASCI review of every asset). Zero ad-spend markup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I book a free growth audit with ITD?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Book a free 30-minute Calendly discovery call. A senior partner runs the call. We audit your current GMB + Instagram + Facebook + website + WhatsApp + benchmark against 3-5 competing clinics in your specialty + city + share a customized 90-day plan within 3 working days. Or use the package selection form on this page — we respond within 24 hours."}}]}</script>

